@switch INTERACT_VERB
@case "look"
	An ornate chest.
	It's closed.
@case "open"
	It's a mimic!
@case "take"
	It's a mimic!
@case "kick"
	It was a mimic.
	It really didn't appreciate that.
	@do game_over
@case "throw rock at"
	It was a mimic.
	It really didn't appreciate that.
	@do game_over
@case "pet"
	It doesn't trust you.
@case "talk to"
	If humans can't understand dragons, what could possibly make you think they can understand mimics?
@case else
	Cannot do.
